          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A class of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+error+correcting+codes"} quantum error correcting codes
            whose
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/code+subspaces"} code subspaces
            are the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/images"} images
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+maps"} linear maps
            given by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+networks"} tensor networks
            of the shape of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/round+chord+diagrams"} round chord diagrams
            with chords acting as
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Majorana+dimer"} Majorana dimers
          %p
            The Majorana dimer code subsumes the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/HaPPY+code"} HaPPY code
          %div{:style => "margin: -40px 0px 20px 10px"}
            %figure{:style => "margin: 0 0 0 0"}
              %img{:src => "/nlab/files/HaPPYCodesAsDimerCode.jpg", :width => "680px"}/
              %figcaption{:style => "text-align: center"}
                From
                %a{:href => "#JGPE19"} JGPE 19
          %p
            and makes the nature of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+entanglement+entropy"} holographic entanglement entropy
            particularly manifest (see
            %a{:href => "holographic+entanglement+entropy#ChordDiagramRepresentation"} there
            for more).
